    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113875" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χηλός</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>large chest, coffer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χηλοῦ δ᾽ ἀπὸ πῶμ᾽ ἀνέῳγε καλῆς
					δαιδαλέης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.221
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐϋξέστῃ ἐνὶ χηλῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					13.10
				</span></i>
			, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κενεᾶς ἐν πυθμένι χηλοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					16.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>coffin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
